window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-017-e66ca15793afb859.json"]={sha256:"e66ca15793afb8592c6e6da2d81db0aa9917065ca428ec1bbe2d391894d94f77",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-03c052c71ca82c39","url":"https://theupdateframework.github.io/specification/v1.0.36/","title":"The Update Framework specification 1.0.36","titleEn":"The Update Framework specification 1.0.36","publisher":"The Update Framework","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-017","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-017","related":[{"id":"security-v27-018","referenceUrls":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3161.html"],"title":"RFC3161時間戳：摘要、nonce與精度區間","titleEn":"RFC 3161 timestamps: imprint, nonce and accuracy intervals","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：2/3與1可重算，版本跳號與複製簽章反例被拒；雙門檻未滿前不可更新信任狀態。 交付root-transition.json、去重後簽章矩陣與拒絕理由；測試keyid為虛構識別，沒有正式私鑰。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 2/3 and 1, reject skipped versions and duplicate inflation, and leave trusted state unchanged until both thresholds pass. Deliver root-transition.json, the deduplicated signature matrix and rejection reasons. Key identifiers are synthetic and the exercise contains no production private keys.","difference":"建立請求摘要、雜湊演算法、nonce及回應token描述；逐一替換摘要、nonce及TSA授權，觀察哪個契約首先失敗。","differenceEn":"Create request-imprint, hash-algorithm, nonce and response-token descriptors. Substitute imprint, nonce and TSA authorization separately, recording which contract fails first rather than collapsing every rejection into an expired-token message.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["同一新根須依舊根與新根要求各自驗證；一個KEYID只能計一次。以每側有效唯一簽章數除以門檻，再取較小值，作為本課的瓶頸指標。 舊根門檻2且有效唯一簽章2，新根門檻3且有效唯一簽章2；另外附一份重複的新根簽章，不能增加計數。 瓶頸min(2/2,2/3)=2/3；補第三個有效新keyid後min(2/2,3/3)=1，兩側才都足額。","本課兩個時間戳使用同一可信時基與已宣告精度；以最早可能完成時間減最晚可能開始時間，得到可證明的最小間隔。未宣告精度不可自行當零。 第一時間戳中心1000秒、精度±2秒，第二中心1010秒、精度±3秒；簽章、摘要與nonce先假設已通過獨立檢查。 最小分離(1010−3)−(1000+2)=5秒；第二精度擴大至±6秒時只剩2秒。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Verify the proposed root under both old and new requirements, counting each KEYID once. Divide valid unique signatures by each threshold and take the smaller ratio as a local bottleneck indicator; acceptance still requires both sides to meet their thresholds. The old threshold is two with two valid unique signatures; the new threshold is three with two. Include a duplicate new-root signature object, which must not increase the count or disguise the missing independent signer. The bottleneck is min(2/2, 2/3)=2/3. Adding a third valid new KEYID makes min(2/2, 3/3)=1. A ratio below one identifies an unmet quorum, not a percentage probability of compromise.","Two classroom timestamps share a trusted time base and declared accuracy. Subtract latest possible start from earliest possible finish to obtain a defensible minimum separation. Missing accuracy must not be silently interpreted as zero uncertainty. The first center is 1000 seconds with ±2-second accuracy; the second is 1010 with ±3. Signature, imprint and nonce are assumed to have passed independent checks before applying interval arithmetic. Minimum separation is (1010−3)−(1000+2)=5 seconds. Widening only the second accuracy to ±6 leaves two seconds. Subtracting centers alone would overstate the supported temporal separation.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-027","referenceUrls":["https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/extensions/filters/http/ext_authz/v3/ext_authz.proto.html"],"title":"Envoy ext_authz：逾時預算與失敗開放邊界","titleEn":"Envoy ext_authz: timeout budgets and failure-mode boundaries","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：2/3與1可重算，版本跳號與複製簽章反例被拒；雙門檻未滿前不可更新信任狀態。 交付root-transition.json、去重後簽章矩陣與拒絕理由；測試keyid為虛構識別，沒有正式私鑰。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reproduce 2/3 and 1, reject skipped versions and duplicate inflation, and leave trusted state unchanged until both thresholds pass. Deliver root-transition.json, the deduplicated signature matrix and rejection reasons. Key identifiers are synthetic and the exercise contains no production private keys.","difference":"建立本地時間線含網路去回、排隊、評估及回傳；附允許、拒絕、5xx及逾時四種描述，固定敏感路由採failure_mode_allow=false。","differenceEn":"Build a local timeline with round-trip transport, queueing, evaluation and response costs. Include allow, deny, 5xx and timeout descriptors, fixing failure_mode_allow=false for the synthetic sensitive route.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["同一新根須依舊根與新根要求各自驗證；一個KEYID只能計一次。以每側有效唯一簽章數除以門檻，再取較小值，作為本課的瓶頸指標。 舊根門檻2且有效唯一簽章2，新根門檻3且有效唯一簽章2；另外附一份重複的新根簽章，不能增加計數。 瓶頸min(2/2,2/3)=2/3；補第三個有效新keyid後min(2/2,3/3)=1，兩側才都足額。","本課總授權預算200毫秒，剩餘值為預算減各階段耗時；正值只代表時間模型可容納，實際許可仍取決於可信授權回應。 去回網路40毫秒、排隊30毫秒、評估80毫秒，暫將序列化納入評估；所有數字為教學假設，非Envoy基準測試。 餘裕200−40−30−80=50毫秒；排隊增至70時剩10毫秒，不能仍宣稱原來的突發負載容忍度。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Verify the proposed root under both old and new requirements, counting each KEYID once. Divide valid unique signatures by each threshold and take the smaller ratio as a local bottleneck indicator; acceptance still requires both sides to meet their thresholds. The old threshold is two with two valid unique signatures; the new threshold is three with two. Include a duplicate new-root signature object, which must not increase the count or disguise the missing independent signer. The bottleneck is min(2/2, 2/3)=2/3. Adding a third valid new KEYID makes min(2/2, 3/3)=1. A ratio below one identifies an unmet quorum, not a percentage probability of compromise.","The selected authorization budget is 200 milliseconds, with remaining margin equal to budget minus stage costs. Positive margin means only that the timing model fits; permission still requires a trustworthy allow response. Use 40 milliseconds of round-trip transport, 30 of queueing and 80 of evaluation, including serialization in the latter. These values are teaching assumptions, not an Envoy benchmark or promised deployment latency. Margin is 200−40−30−80=50 milliseconds. Increasing queueing to 70 leaves ten milliseconds, reducing tolerance for additional delay even though the request remains within the nominal budget.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-9057a80251c1f13b","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3161.html","title":"RFC 3161: Time-Stamp Protocol","titleEn":"RFC 3161: Time-Stamp Protocol","publisher":"IETF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-6f769063a729e9a3","url":"https://www.envoyproxy.io/docs/envoy/latest/api-v3/extensions/filters/http/ext_authz/v3/ext_authz.proto.html","title":"Envoy external authorization v3 API","titleEn":"Envoy external authorization v3 API","publisher":"Envoy","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
